{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for VintageChrono', 'description': "Primary container for VintageChrono implementation: PastBlast is a responsive web app that lets users explore historical events for any date, styled with a vintage newspaper aesthetic. It integrates Wikipedia's 'On This Day' API to display notable events, and optionally the NYT Archive and Archive.org for period headlines and imagery. Features include a rotary date picker, timeline slider, wax seal/typewriter key buttons, and interactive elements like 'Random Year' and 'My Birth Year'. The UI uses parchment backgrounds, old-style fonts, and ink-smudge/page-turn effects for a realistic, engaging experience.", 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Date Picker",\n      "description": "A rotary or brass-dial styled date picker allowing users to select any day, month, and year. Defaults to today\\u2019s date.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Timeline Slider",\n      "description": "A pocket-watch face styled slider to quickly browse through years or decades.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Historical Events Feed",\n      "description": "Displays 5\\u201310 notable events from Wikipedia\'s \'On This Day\' API for the selected date, shown as newspaper clipping cards or accordions.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "NYT Headlines (Optional)",\n      "description": "Shows 2\\u20133 headlines from the New York Times Archive API for the selected month/year, styled as newsprint cutouts with source links and thumbnails.",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Random Year Button",\n      "description": "A \'\\ud83c\\udfb2 Random Year\' button styled as a wax seal or typewriter key, jumping to a surprise date.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "My Birth Year Feature",\n      "description": "A \'\\ud83d\\udcdc My Birth Year\' button that fetches events for the user\\u2019s birth date.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Sound Toggle",\n      "description": "Toggle for vintage typewriter clicks or phonograph music.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Loading Animation",\n      "description": "Paper-flip or quill-writing animation while loading data.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive Design",\n      "description": "Fully responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2f2f2f",\n    "secondary": "#6a4e42",\n    "accent": "#bfa77a"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app uses a parchment-textured background with faded paper borders and subtle creases. At the top, a bold, vintage masthead displays the app name in \'Cormorant Garamond\' or \'Playfair Display\'. Below, the rotary date picker and timeline slider are centered. Main content area features newspaper clipping cards/accordions for events, with wax seal/typewriter key buttons for actions. Optional NYT headlines and Archive.org images appear as newsprint cutouts. Footer includes sound toggle and credits. All elements are spaced for readability and touch, with ink-smudge hover effects and page-turn transitions. Layout adapts fluidly to all screen sizes."\n}'}",
